        1997,
        2231
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) Coordination of New York City's Civil Defense effort in accordance with the provisions of the Defense Emergency Act of New York State and development of a Civil Defense Emergency operations plan involving all relevant municipal agencies;",
